00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:27.245
coverage the necessary operational information goes through the approved restricted

00:00:27.245 --> 00:00:31.305
route The existence of a protected block is not permission

00:00:31.305 --> 00:00:35.950
to investigate its purpose or disclose its detail 4 Routine

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:41.230
decision authority Daniel may arrange and move routine internal administrative

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:45.660
meetings within agreed available periods when no protected commitment external

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:51.775
